  "text": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-c27b3ab3c8@example.invalid",
    "text": "<p>Stryker Corporation&nbsp;(NYSE:SYK) announced that it will host a conference call on&nbsp;Tuesday, July 24, 2018&nbsp;at&nbsp;4:30 p.m., Eastern Time, to discuss the Company's operating results for the quarter ended&nbsp;June 30, 2018&nbsp;and provide an operational update. Final operating results for the quarter ended&nbsp;June 30, 2018&nbsp;will be released at&nbsp;4:05 p.m.&nbsp;that day.</p>\n<p>See full release <a href=\"https://investors.stryker.com/press-releases/news-details/2018/Stryker-to-host-conference-call-on-July-24-2018/default.aspx\">here</a>.&nbsp;</p>\n",
